    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature is in danger!</strong><br><strong>A mysterious toxic smoke rises from underground, corrupting nature and turning the island\u2019s creatures into hostile, aggressive beings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your village and protect your new home by battling corrupted creatures, exploring the island, and venturing into the deep underground labyrinths. Uncover the origin of the poisonous fumes and put an end to the threat endangering the entire island!</strong><br><br>Get ready for an adventure filled with action, mystery, and exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Traverse forests, beaches, and caves as you search every corner of the island. Discover ancient temples, mysterious caves, and landscapes twisted by corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Face corrupted creatures with a fluid and responsive action-combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices &amp; Consequences:</strong> Every decision will influence the island\u2019s fate and your own future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Abilities:</strong> Fight, gain experience and level up, becoming increasingly stronger. Find ancient artifacts, new weapons, and develop new abilities to fight the growing evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/cedc904ae5dbe1313d4af057beed55fd.avif?t=1740734349\" width=631 height=265 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Unique Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a diverse cast, each with their own backstory and personality, enhancing your gameplay with rich and memorable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/4d56877ca8fc243f27de56865cfda65a.avif?t=1740734349\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Stunning 2D Pixel Art World </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted pixel art that brings the game\u2019s natural environments to life. Each scenario is teeming with unique creatures and slimes, making every area a delight to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Quests and Minigames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From charming cats to engaging minigames, a variety of side quests offer hours of entertainment and diverse gameplay to keep you captivated.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nature is in danger!</strong><br><strong>A mysterious toxic smoke rises from underground, corrupting nature and turning the island\u2019s creatures into hostile, aggressive beings.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend your village and protect your new home by battling corrupted creatures, exploring the island, and venturing into the deep underground labyrinths. Uncover the origin of the poisonous fumes and put an end to the threat endangering the entire island!</strong><br><br>Get ready for an adventure filled with action, mystery, and exploration!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/22be792fbef43841c7a7354515a290d7.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-World Exploration:</strong> Traverse forests, beaches, and caves as you search every corner of the island. Discover ancient temples, mysterious caves, and landscapes twisted by corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/2d3b94e449704495c34f3aaf4e378c99.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat:</strong> Face corrupted creatures with a fluid and responsive action-combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices &amp; Consequences:</strong> Every decision will influence the island\u2019s fate and your own future.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrades &amp; Abilities:</strong> Fight, gain experience and level up, becoming increasingly stronger. Find ancient artifacts, new weapons, and develop new abilities to fight the growing evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/cedc904ae5dbe1313d4af057beed55fd.avif?t=1740734349\" width=631 height=265 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet Unique Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a diverse cast, each with their own backstory and personality, enhancing your gameplay with rich and memorable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/4d56877ca8fc243f27de56865cfda65a.avif?t=1740734349\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Stunning 2D Pixel Art World </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in beautifully crafted pixel art that brings the game\u2019s natural environments to life. Each scenario is teeming with unique creatures and slimes, making every area a delight to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.poster.avif?t=1740734349\" width=800 height=422 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.webm?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365380/extras/7d30bae449ffa1118b87038249928fed.mp4?t=1740734349\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side Quests and Minigames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From charming cats to engaging minigames, a variety of side quests offer hours of entertainment and diverse gameplay to keep you captivated.</p></li></ul>",
